    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Aug 2024 08:02:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>嗨，欢迎做客【自游自在】</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>愿你在人间遨游 活的自由自在</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👸主播说：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>秉着接纳一切记录一切的想法，还是决定把这期</span><strong><span>太！不！完！美！</span></strong><span>的节目发出来，</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>毕竟真实和真诚的表达才是我们最原本的态度。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>关于</span><strong><span>|自游自在 UNFETTERED|：</span></strong><span>不设限 不设门 希望游客们喜欢</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>我们的节目会围绕着【关系】【困惑】【自由】【成长】展开；有二人转，有单口，有采访</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>话不多说，跟着两位刚刚长途旅行回来的播主一起听听旅行中伴侣的那点事儿吧</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>👯‍♀️本期播主：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>11年金融民工；爱折腾也爱自由的ENFJ；斜杠身份Life coach加载中----</span><strong><span>Tyra 婷</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>拥有成熟婚恋观的不成熟已婚人士，ENFP，希望和大家一起操练爱与被爱的能力 ----</span><strong><span>Jessica 晓雯</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>⏱️时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> 家庭关系重要性排序的有趣观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> 本期主题：旅行中的两性关系</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>旅行是检验感情的最好方式吗？旅行中都会遇到哪些问题？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> 常说旅行是考验感情的最好方式？真的吗？为什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 旅行中可能发生的问题和解决办法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 旅行中如何更好沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a> 如何避免成为生活差评师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1957">32:37</a> 解决沟通问题的实用工具--“爱箱”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如何提升旅行体验？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a> 小朋友：带or不带</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 夫妻二人独处计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2908">48:28</a> 如何提升和伴侣的旅行体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3552">59:12</a> 下期更精彩哦！</span></p>]]></description>
